            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Controlled substance management agreements (contracts) are widely used by pain specialists in the United States, but what do they contain? This survey analysis answers that question by taking a thorough look at 41 controlled substance medication management agreements from physicians in private practice.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
